  m_Name: Evento_InfraestruturaUrbanaObsoleta
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Infraestrutura Urbana Obsoleta
  _titleEn: Aging Urban Infrastructure
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Pontes, redes de \xE1gua e pr\xE9dios p\xFAblicos se desgastam; sem
    manuten\xE7\xE3o, o risco de falha cresce at\xE9 virar trag\xE9dia."
  _summaryEn: Bridges, water networks and public buildings wear out; without maintenance,
    the risk of failure grows until it becomes a tragedy.
  _realWorld: "A ponte Morandi, em G\xEAnova, na It\xE1lia, desabou em agosto de
    2018 e matou 43 pessoas; investiga\xE7\xF5es apontaram falhas de manuten\xE7\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: The Morandi bridge in Genoa, Italy, collapsed in August 2018 and
    killed 43 people; investigations pointed to maintenance failures.
  _tradeOffs: "Manuten\xE7\xE3o n\xE3o aparece em placa de inaugura\xE7\xE3o, por
    isso costuma ser adiada."
  _tradeOffsEn: Maintenance never gets a ribbon-cutting ceremony, so it tends to
    be postponed.
  _sources:
  - Label: Ponte Morandi (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ponte_Morandi
